What this package is. Leviathan is a Julia port of the
Euler-characteristic-drop method for Landau singularities of Feynman integrals
of Vsevolod Chestnov, Giulio Crisanti and Mathieu Giroux ("Landau's
Leviathans", arXiv:2606.29612) and of the elimination object of SPQR by
Vsevolod Chestnov and Giulio Crisanti (arXiv:2511.14875). It was written with
the authors' public Mathematica code open. No file of the authors ships here.
This is an unofficial port, not affiliated with or endorsed by the authors;
please cite both papers.

